# Cloudflare Pages publishes everything in the output directory, and the output
# directory is the repo root. Without this file the live site would serve the
# band's editing manual, the database migrations and the Cloudflare config.
#
# Note: functions/ is NOT listed. Pages treats it specially — it becomes the
# API rather than static files — and listing it here would break the routes.

.claude
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.example
.gitignore
.wrangler
EDITING.md
README.md
SETUP-CLOUDFLARE.md
migrations
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
scripts
wrangler.toml
